            "Key": "OakRod",
            "SourceString": "Oak rod is much like its anagram: it's an A-OK rod. Not brilliant, not terrible.\r\n\r\nIt's a rod that you will you look back on fondly when you wield the mighty maple rod. \"Ah, I remember when I used to use an oak rod\", you will say, as you bite the head off a live catfish and stand astride a pile of infernal eels. \r\n\r\nFor now, appreciate your time with it. You will miss it once you have left it behind.",
